Long time no see. How have you been?

We have lived through a time of peace since Midranda's defeat. But we keep searching for the Fragments of the Fire Soul. We have an exploration group, led by Praya, looking for clues about the cause of the constant earthquakes.
Praya sent us a message. After the last tremor, a passage was revealed inside the cave where Kelvezu lives.

Please, help them explore the place.

[Challenge Objective]

Go to the Heart of Fire, in the marked area.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
